Privacy Policy for Thai Travel Babel
Effective Date: September 27, 2026

Thank you for playing Thai Travel Babel.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you use the Thai Travel Babel mobile application.

1. Information We Collect
Thai Travel Babel does not require you to create an account, and we do not directly collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, or other information that directly identifies you.

However, Thai Travel Babel uses third-party advertising services, including Google AdMob. These services may automatically collect certain information from your device in order to provide advertisements, measure their performance, prevent fraud, and maintain the advertising service.

Depending on your device, settings, location, and consent choices, this information may include:

IP address
Device and advertising identifiers
General device information
App interactions, such as app launches, taps, and ad interactions
Diagnostic and performance information
Approximate location derived from information such as your IP address
We do not directly receive information that identifies you personally from Google AdMob.

The Thai words you hear are recordings included with the app. Thai Travel Babel does not use your device's microphone, camera, contacts or location services.

2. Information Stored on Your Device
Thai Travel Babel keeps a record of your play so that your progress, awards and settings are there the next time you play. This includes the number of games you have finished, the categories you have finished and those you have finished without a mistake, the Thai words you have answered correctly, your current and longest run of correct answers, the run of days on which you have finished a game, the awards you have won and the day each was won, your sound volumes and your chosen difficulty.

This information is stored only on your own device. It is not transmitted to us, it is not transmitted to any third party, and we have no access to it.

You can erase your record of play and your awards at any time using the RESET control on the app's settings screen. Your sound volumes and difficulty are kept until you change them. Uninstalling the app erases all of it.

3. Advertising
Thai Travel Babel is supported by advertisements provided through Google AdMob.

The app shows banner advertisements on its menu and other screens. When a game earns you awards, it offers an optional rewarded video advertisement: watching it to the end collects them. Watching a rewarded video is always your choice; declining it leaves the awards uncollected.

Depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices, advertisements may be personalized or non-personalized.

Google and its advertising partners may use device identifiers and other information to provide, measure, personalize, and improve advertising and to detect and prevent fraud.

For more information about how Google uses information from apps that use its services, please see Google's privacy information:

https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

4. Internet Access
Thai Travel Babel requires internet access for certain features, including loading and displaying advertisements.

The core gameplay may function without an internet connection, but advertisements, including the rewarded video that collects your awards, may not be available while offline.

5. Consent and Privacy Choices
Where required by applicable law, users may be presented with a consent message that allows them to make choices regarding the use of their information for advertising purposes.

Where such a choice has been presented, it can be revisited at any time using the PRIVACY OPTIONS control on the app's settings screen.

Users may also be able to control advertising personalization and advertising identifiers through their device privacy settings.

6. Children's Privacy
Thai Travel Babel is a general-audience game.

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.

Advertising services used by the app may process information as described in this Privacy Policy. Where required, appropriate restrictions are applied to advertising and data processing.

Parents or guardians who have questions regarding their child's privacy may contact us using the email address provided below.

7. Data Security
We do not operate our own servers for collecting or storing users' personal information.

Information processed by third-party services such as Google AdMob is handled according to their respective privacy and security practices.

Information transmitted by the Google Mobile Ads SDK is encrypted in transit.

8. Third-Party Services
Thai Travel Babel uses third-party services that may collect or process information according to their own privacy policies.

The primary third-party service currently used by Thai Travel Babel is:

Google AdMob — advertising, including rewarded video advertising, advertising measurement, analytics related to advertising, and fraud prevention.

Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy

Information about Google's use of data from apps using Google services: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

9. In-App Purchases
Thai Travel Babel does not currently offer in-app purchases.

If this changes in the future, this Privacy Policy will be updated where necessary.

10. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy if the app, advertising services, legal requirements, or our data practices change.

Any revised Privacy Policy will be posted with an updated Effective Date.

